<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>马乃东律师近期动态</title><link>https://naidongma.com/updates/</link><description>马乃东律师的专业文章与活动。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 04:00:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://naidongma.com/updates/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>马乃东律师参加首届“STEP 大中华区家族财富闭门圆桌”</title><link>https://naidongma.com/updates/2026-10-30-step-greater-china-roundtable/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://naidongma.com/updates/2026-10-30-step-greater-china-roundtable/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description>10月19日，马乃东律师受邀参加在新加坡举行的首届 STEP 大中华区家族财富闭门圆桌，从争议解决视角交流跨境婚姻协议、遗嘱及意定监护安排。</description></item><item><title>马乃东律师在“证券犯罪司法规制新格局与实务前沿交流会”发表主题演讲</title><link>https://naidongma.com/updates/2026-10-29-securities-crime-seminar/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://naidongma.com/updates/2026-10-29-securities-crime-seminar/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description>10月9日，马乃东律师在上海以“家族律师视角下大佬们的证券刑事法律风险”为题发表演讲，分享家族争议中证券刑事风险识别、资产盘查与证据固定的实务经验。</description></item><item><title>港股科技公司关键人离婚法律问题实务（一）：中国内地科技类企业在港股上市的门槛、标准</title><link>https://naidongma.com/updates/2026-06-29-hk-tech-company-divorce-listing-standards/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://naidongma.com/updates/2026-06-29-hk-tech-company-divorce-listing-standards/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 09:44:00 GMT</pubDate><description>本文系统梳理中国内地科技企业在港股上市的门槛、主要路径与沿革，并分析科技企业关键人离婚对股权稳定、估值、控制权和信息披露的影响。</description></item></channel></rss>
